1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Mountains have always called to explorers,
hikers climb steep rocky trails through

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,150
pine forests,

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:09,980
higher up the trees disappear
and snow covers the peaks.

4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:14,040
From the summit, you can see clouds
drifting over the valleys below.

5
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:18,240
A cold wind blows, but the
view is worth every step.
